ember-wireguard is a Qt 6 manager for WireGuard tunnels through wg(8) and
wireguard-go. It lists configs from PKG_SYSCONFDIR/wireguard,
~/.config/ember-wireguard, and ~/.config/wireguard. The window follows the
official WireGuard client layout (list, Active/Inactive, Activate/Deactivate,
Import, Add Empty Tunnel, Edit, Delete, public key, transfer). A setuid helper
brings tunnels up and down on NetBSD tun(4) interfaces.
